  "sse": {
    "path": "/conversations/{conversation_id}/events",
    "method": "GET",
    "replay": "Last-Event-ID 使用 Event Sequence；先回放至高水位，再消费实时通知并去重",
    "envelope": {
      "id": "event sequence（整数，单调递增）",
      "event": "conversation.event | activity.updated | execution.progress | approval.requested",
      "data": {
        "seq": "integer",
        "type": "string",
        "aggregate": "string",
        "aggregate_id": "uuid",
        "occurred_at": "rfc3339",
        "payload": "object"
      }
    },
    "heartbeat_seconds": 15,
    "reconnect_backoff_seconds": [
      1,
      2,
      5,
      10,
      30
    ]
  },
  "notes": [
    "一个复合命令对应一个动作接口；服务端在同一事务内完成组内全部聚合更新。",
    "动作接口不接受直接写 status 的 PATCH；状态只能经 actions 改变。",
    "响应必须包含 status、state_version、allowed_actions。",
    "知识库接口按题目级设计：检索与引用单元是 question，不是 document；分类来自 knowledge_categories。",
    "导出分两步：先渲染并提供预览地址，教师确认后再下载；预览与下载使用同一份渲染产物。"
  ]
}
